  "summary": "Unpinned GitHub dependency source resolves to mutable third-party HEAD",
  "details": "package.json declares the `libsignal` dependency as `github:RILLYZY/libsignal-node` — a personal GitHub repository with no commit SHA, tag, or semver pin. On `npm install`, npm fetches whatever bytes the default branch currently points to and executes any lifecycle scripts contained in that source. The repository owner is unrelated to the package's publisher and can push new content to that branch at any time, causing every subsequent install of @neroxkira/vangal-baileys to run that new code on the installer's machine with no integrity check.",
